ough the MacSparky Field Guides\nhttps://learn.macsparky.com\n\n⚙️ Join the MacSparky Labs\nhttps://www.macsparky.com/join/\n\n🗞️ Subscribe to the MacSparky Newsletter\n\nhttps://sparky-media-inc.ck.page/2eb4ea7041\n\n🎙️I’m the co-host of two podcasts on Relay FM:\n\nMac Power Users 🖥️ https://www.relay.fm/mpu\n\nFocused 👓 https://www.relay.fm/focused","thumb":{"$type":"blob","ref":{"$link":"bafkreiah7br7f265mjardtysjjjhqzphj3wgcj3lydzlew3q56dgruotdu"},"mimeType":"image/jpeg","size":122706},"title":"Why I'm Buying the iPhone Duo Instead of the iPhone 18 Pro Max","uri":"https://youtu.be/gW77mX5XRwo"}},"facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"iphoneduo"}],"index":{"byteEnd":229,"byteStart":219}},{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#link","uri":"https://youtu.be/gW77mX5XRwo"}],"index":{"byteEnd":210,"byteStart":190}}],"langs":["en"],"text":"When an Apple blogger I read makes a YouTube video and it explodes in popularity, it kind of validates that the iPhone Duo will be bought by a huge amount of people and not just Apple nerds youtu.be/gW77mX5XRwo\n#iphoneduo"},"embed":{"external":{"uri":"https://youtu.be/gW77mX5XRwo","title":"Why I'm Buying the iPhone Duo Instead of the iPhone 18 Pro Max","description":"The iPhone Duo may be the most interesting iPhone buying decision Apple has given us in years. This isn’t a review—I haven’t touched one yet—but I already know which way I’m leaning.\n\nIn this video, I explain why the new interface and larger folding screen have me willing to give up the better camera, take a chance on first-generation hardware, and spend a lot of money for what could essentially become an iPad mini in my pocket. I also look at the trade-offs and who should probably stick with the iPhone Pro instead.\n\nTimestamps:\n\n00:00 - Intro\n01:01 - The Software\n01:55 - Why I'm Buying the iPhone Duo\n02:58 - The Tradeoffs\n04:30 - Who Should Buy What?\n\n\n▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬ All About MacSparky ▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n\n📄 Read my Blog\nhttps